          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 129304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki będzie wynik, zakładając dane wejściowe <code>10</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Poniżej 21 lat</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>21 or older</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Poniżej 21 lat</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Blok <code>if</code> jest uruchamiany, gdy jego warunek ma wartość <code>True</code>. W przeciwnym razie uruchamiany jest blok <code>else</code>.</p><p>Pokazany wynik dotyczy danych wejściowych <code>10</code>. Który ostatni wiersz wyświetli kod, jeśli użytkownik wpisze zamiast tego <code>21</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>21 or older</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Poniżej 21 lat</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>21</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>21 or older</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
